WEBVTT

00:00:07.432 --> 00:00:08.092
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:09.058 --> 00:00:11.546
<v><b>A:</b></v> How are you going to get there?

00:00:13.421 --> 00:00:14.116
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:15.036 --> 00:00:17.360
<v><b>B:</b></v> Where are you going to stay?

00:00:19.317 --> 00:00:20.037
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:20.983 --> 00:00:23.475
<v><b>A:</b></v> We’re going to stay for a week.

00:00:25.397 --> 00:00:26.178
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:29.337
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m going to see the sights.

00:00:31.285 --> 00:00:32.098
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:32.975 --> 00:00:35.916
<v><b>A:</b></v> We aren’t going to go by car.

00:00:37.856 --> 00:00:38.689
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:39.653 --> 00:00:42.654
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m not going to stay in a hotel.